  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">223266_Start Fund Burkina Faso Alert 860 - Anticipation of Flooding</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is meant to provide an anticipatory response to the expected floodings in the Nord and Centre-Nord Regions of Burkina Faso ; considering the imminent threat posed by the floodings, the anticipatory response must be lead efficiently in a short period of time, in order to ensure populations&apos; resilience is strenghtened towards these disasters. The convening agency&apos;s presence and experience in these two regions allows a good knowledge of the context of intervention, of the most urgent needs, and an important insertion within the humanitarian coordination, ensuring a most adequate response.</narrative>
  </description>
